{"id":"715dbcdaf4fc3a32","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-cut-degree.md","title":"Cut Degree","display":"df-cut-degree — Cut Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-cut-degree","aliases":["72-df-cut-degree"],"display":"df-cut-degree — Cut Degree","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-cut-rule]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-cut-free-proof]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4.1 print37/PDF49; local +1 degree convention","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"修复 CutDeg 对 LJ 子域及无切基础演算原先不适用的定义域"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-cut-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-cut-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cut-degree — Cut Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a94e54a928b642a\" href=\"?note=2a94e54a928b642a\" title=\"72-df-cut-rule\">72-df-cut-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44daac0977222042\" href=\"?note=44daac0977222042\" title=\"72-df-cut-free-proof\">72-df-cut-free-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4.1 print37/PDF49; local +1 degree convention"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"修复 CutDeg 对 LJ 子域及无切基础演算原先不适用的定义域"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\)</span>；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；对实际规则集要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{r\\in\\mathsf R:\\pi_0(r)=\\mathsf{cut}\\}\\subseteq\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\{r\\in\\mathsf R:\\pi_0(r)=\\mathsf{cut}\\}\\subseteq\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，后者见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2a94e54a928b642a\" href=\"?note=2a94e54a928b642a\" title=\"72-df-cut-rule\">72-df-cut-rule</a>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0(r)\">\\(\\pi_0(r)\\)</span> 是带标签四元组的首投影；不要求演算包含所有合法 Cut 实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为有限证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi):=\\{u\\in D:\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi(u)=\\mathsf{cut}\\},\\qquad A_u:=\\operatorname{Witness}_\\pi(u)\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi):=\\{u\\in D:\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi(u)=\\mathsf{cut}\\},\\qquad A_u:=\\operatorname{Witness}_\\pi(u)\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi):=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rk}(A_u)+1:u\\in\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi):=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rk}(A_u)+1:u\\in\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{CutFree}_{\\mathcal C}(\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{CutFree}_{\\mathcal C}(\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Cut标签及切公式从η投影；+1使原子切也给正切度。空切集合给0。rank从有限公式树递归，不再假定一个没有定义的complexity函数。</p>\n<p>本轮修正：旧条件 Q=Seq 且必须含全部 Cut，排除了 LJ 的单后件载体，也排除了无切基础演算，却在这些下游上调用 CutDeg。现在只要求实际标为 cut 的实例有正确切公式见证，有限证明的度因而同时覆盖 LK、LJ 及其无切版本。最大值为0当且仅当没有 cut 节点，因为任何合法切秩加1均为正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cut-rule","status":"resolved","id":"2a94e54a928b642a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cut-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cut-free-proof","status":"resolved","id":"44daac0977222042","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cut-free-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 及 $\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的 $\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)$；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cut-rule","status":"resolved","id":"2a94e54a928b642a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$；对实际规则集要求 $\\{r\\in\\mathsf R:\\pi_0(r)=\\mathsf{cut}\\}\\subseteq\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma$，后者见 [[72-df-cut-rule]]。其中 $\\pi_0(r)$ 是带标签四元组的首投影；不要求演算包含所有合法 Cut 实例。$\\pi$ 为有限证明。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{r\\in\\mathsf R:\\pi_0(r)=\\mathsf{cut}\\}\\subseteq\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0(r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi):=\\{u\\in D:\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi(u)=\\mathsf{cut}\\},\\qquad A_u:=\\operatorname{Witness}_\\pi(u)\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi):=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rk}(A_u)+1:u\\in\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{CutFree}_{\\mathcal C}(\\pi).","display":true}],"bytes":2213,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-cut-degree|df-cut-degree — Cut Degree]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-cut-degree — Cut Degree](72-df-cut-degree.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-cut-degree|df-cut-degree — Cut Degree]]"},{"id":"fced0c3529ef3729","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0a280d5aaff0f54d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c98701cd6a6317eb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-cut-degree]]"},{"id":"57199c40d155f4ba","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-cut-degree]]"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4","2a94e54a928b642a","3c073b947b255638","44daac0977222042"]}